# biometrics: Fingerprint and Face groups (Privacy & Security). Check in each look.
# Only meaningful on a host with a fingerprint reader; if no reader, both shells must show nothing (write "no reader").
# Never press Add, Remove, Install, Set Up, PAM switches or the Face buttons.
ipc panels settings security
wait 2
shot bio-top
note B1: Fingerprint group (reader row or finger rows, footer "Password prompts, sudo..."), then Face group; same rows, texts and order in both shells; with no reader and no IR camera neither group shows (write "no reader").
ptr move 1100 600 scroll 0 3
wait 1
shot bio-scroll
note B1 cont.: after a small scroll the Fingerprint/Face groups look the same in both shells (same rows/texts/order).
# MANUAL: B2 click the finger Dropdown (y read from a shot), shot the list, Esc. QML: item height 36 Material / 28 Glass, list at least 200 wide, right edge on the control's, 4 px under it; write Rust's sizes.
# MANUAL: B3 click the Dropdown, Esc, key Down: the next finger is chosen without the list opening (Rust must do the same).
# MANUAL: B4 click Remove on a finger row (only asks): detail "It's deleted from the reader..." with Keep and "Remove <name>"; click Keep: back to Remove, nothing removed.
ipc panels close
